# Collect logs of any wood type. The first rung of the first-night chain: no
# tool needed. `#logs` comes from the 26.3 block tag, so birch, spruce and the
# other woods work on any seed. No log in sight means walk to a frontier of the
# perception known map before mining; `explore` sleeps at most 1200 ticks.
skill get_wood(n: int = 1)
  doc "Collect at least n logs of any wood type."
  rules:
    count(#logs) >= $n -> done
    not near(#logs, 5) -> explore(#logs)
    true -> mine(#logs)
